# Power BI Desktop's local files: per-machine settings and the data cache (it holds client data).
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
**/.pbi/cache.abf
# A .pbix is a binary copy of the same model with the data inside. The .pbip project is the
# source of truth: it stores the model as text (TMDL), so changes can be reviewed in a diff.
*.pbix
